      "value": "Sorry, this is the wrong place to open a ticket like this. Please open a ticket at https://vrch.at/moderation. \n\nIf you do not receive a response to that ticket or any of your tickets after a week, please contact me at tupper@vrchat.com with the ticket number of the problematic ticket.",
