  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've been successfully getting people banned for breaking rules for weeks now but suddenly a few days ago none of the reports are doing anything anymore. A whole group of people have been crashing lobbies with dragonball z particle bombs and laughing in my face when I fail to get them banned for it and just inviting all of their friends to join in the particle bombing.\n\nThe moderators aren't supposed to send the \"we are investigating your ticket\" without actually investigating the ticket. I think this first started when I tried to report a guy repeatedly for being one of those \"avatar creators\" that instead of selling people assets for avatars, they force them to pay absurd fees to share their account with him to upload it for him. After failing to get him banned for that the moderators just stopped investigating my claims. I even tried to get somebody banned for a guaranteed ban, with slurs in his bio and they just ignored it after sending in the email about investigating it. The man's bio didn't even get deleted.",
